        rdfs:comment                   "Thin white hankerchief.  In one corner is a Nazi drowning holding up a swastika as American troops in camoflage stand on the shore.  Illustration is simple: water is rendered using a black curvy line with a small blue area directly under the drowning Nazi."@en ;
